vs
mean() is from base R, which does not support operator, so we need to use summarize() in front of it if we would like to use pipe operator.
with(mtcars, filter(c(1,1,0,0,0,1,1)))
with(mtcars, filter(c(TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)))
with(mtcars, filter(mtcars, c(TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)))
rep(1, 30)
